Kxd3 $11 (45... Kd4 46. a5 Nc3 47. a6 Kd5 $11 {tablebases})) 40... Ke4 41. Kb1
Rb8 42. b5 Ra8 (42... Nb6 {seems simplest} 43. Rh3 (43. Ra3 Kd5 44. Ka2 Kc5 45.
