fxe4 12. Rd1 Qc8 13. Nd4 Bxe5 {Frith-Armstrong, 4NCL 2013,0-1}) 7... Qxd5 8.
O-O $16 Nge7 9. fxe5 Nxe5 10. d4 N5c6 11. Na3 (11. Nbd2 O-O 12. Bc4 Qd7 13. Ne4
$16 {SF16}) 11... Bf5 12. Nh4 (12. Nb5 $1 Rc8 13. c4 Qd7 14. d5 Nb4 15. Bf4 O-O
16. Qd2 a5 17. Rad1 $18 {SF16- the Bl pieces scarcely have any activity, while
controls a great deal of space}) 12... Be6 $14 13. Be3 O-O 14. Bf2 Qd7 15. Nf3
Rad8 16. Bg3 Nf5 17. Bf2 a6 $11 18. Nc2 Rfe8 19. Bd3 Nce7 20. Re1 (20. Ng5 Bd5
21. Nb4 c6 22. Nxd5 Nxd5 23. Qf3 $11 {SF16}) 20... c5 21. Bxf5 Bxf5 (21... Nxf5
) 22. Ne5 Qc7 23. Bg3 {Wh has failed to capitalise on his advantage by
launching a direct attack on the K} Qb6 (23... Bxc2 24. Qxc2 Nf5 25. Qf2 cxd4
$19 {SF16}) 24. Nc4 Qc6 25. Ne5 Bxe5 (25... Qb5 26. b4 Bxc2 27. Qxc2 cxd4 $19 {
SF16}) 26. Rxe5 Bxc2 27. Qxc2 cxd4 $17 28. Qb3 Nf5 $19 (28... d3 $19) 29. Rxe8+
Rxe8 30. cxd4 Nxd4 31. Qd3 Ne2+ 32. Kf1 Nxg3+ 33. Qxg3 (33. hxg3) 33... Qb5+ {
Wh's K is exposed, as the Wh pieces fail to cooperate} 34. Kg1 Qxb2 35. Rf1
Qxa2 36. Qc7 Qd5 37. Rb1 b5 (37... a5 {also}) 38. h4 Qd4+ 0-1

