22... Red8 (22... Nd3 23. Ne1 Nxd5 24. exd5 Qxd5 25. f3 f5 26. Nf1 e4 $11 {
SF16- but Bl has more choice in moves}) 23. Nf1 $11 Kh8 24. Ne3 Ng8 25. Ng5 (
