9... h6 {main lines}) 10. Kh2 $14 {1-1-3} (10. Nbd2 {9-1-2.} Bxh3 {is no real
threat} 11. gxh3 Qxh3 12. Nh2 {is simplest, keeps the N from g4 & allows the Q
to come across} (12. Nf1 Ng4 13. N3h2 Nxf2 14. Kxf2 Bh4+ 15. Kg1 Bxe1 16. Qxe1
f5 17. Qg3 $18 {Maggiolo-Fratti, Buenos Aires ch women 2008,1-0})) 10... h6
