32. b3 Na5 33. Bb1 (33. Qg4 Rac8 (33... Ra7 34. f4 $18) 34. e6 $18 {SF16})
33... Rac8 34. Rxc8 Rxc8 35. Qg4 Rc7 36. Nh5+ $18 (36. e6 $18 {also}) 36... Kh8
37. Nf6 Qxf2 38. Qb4 (38. Re2 Qc5 39. Qh4 Qc1 40. Ne8 Kg8 41. Qf6 Ne6 42. Nxc7
Qxc7 43. Bxg6 $18 {Sf16}) 38... Ne6 39. Qxa5 Ng5 (39... Nf4 40. Rg1 Ne2 41. Re1
